#. それが、私の発言にどう関わってくるのかしら？
#. それとも…何も考えていないの？
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What does that have to do with what I said? Or do you\n"
"just not know what you're doing?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それが、私の発言にどう関わってくるのかしら？
#. それとも…何も考えていないの？
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What does that have to do with what I said? Or do you\n"
"just not know what you're doing?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ほうほう、なるほど。
#. それはつまり…って全然わかんねーぞ！
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hmm, yes, I see. So what you're saying is...I have\n"
"absolutely no idea!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの部屋に武道場の鍵を置いたのは、
#. 彼女以外の誰か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko says it wasn't her who left the key to the dojo\n"
"locker in her room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本当に…そうなのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But is that really true?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>裁判前に、霧切さん自身が話してくれたはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko herself told me before the trial started...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女が学園長室から盗み出した、
#. 例の物について…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...that she had stolen something very important from\n"
"the headmaster's room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
